agents/**/r3test/
agents/**/zzz/
agents/**/ttt/
agents/**/tkt-A/
agents/**/tkt-B/
agents/**/tkt-wt/
agents/**/_body-*.tmp.md

# user-tier POLYBIUS housekeeping (Arc 61 pre-branch hygiene, 2026-06-17) — keep the-stoa main tree clean.
# HANDOFF_*/HUMAN_paste-*/PLAN_* tracked home is the beadwork branch (attach to a ticket), NOT main (§18).
/HANDOFF_*.md
/HUMAN_paste-*.md
/PLAN_*.md
# Chrome MCP browser/tab-group handle — ephemeral working state, re-read on resume (see the memory of the same name)
/BROWSER_SESSION.json
# session backup dirs + Stop-hook runtime sentinels (runtime/throwaway)
.claude.bak-*/
.claude/hooks/.stop-sentinels/
